{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:43Z","created_by_operation":"op_59623779fd27423a9342ca4c1a2d9753","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2beb77f7a345330d0bcacbcbce2460a0930e9d991b9c71bfd8560ae6ae296daf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"storozhenko98/beehive@42e6a36ead6d snapshot 45e04241f2153fbd","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4bf0d67411f7a5a8b035a4815ec993ca61dbe39f079934bf69740c5fb60e25ea","slc_5d76f6eee6365bfa94934906557aef8a57ef70f89eda05ed7d4cc1ab86dc494f","slc_e13e5247d4e81d7da549c4fb3823868e8afdde3f24ce0b93f1b1bb1e49f3a770"],"source_ids":["src_686f3df186985394a61f2568e44dec41"],"text":"A configured comb startup command (e.g. a tmux session) runs once per comb the first time it opens after launch, after which the app returns to an interactive shell in the comb directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:43:43Z","updated_by_operation":"op_59623779fd27423a9342ca4c1a2d9753"}
